  "observations": [
    "All six confirmed translation PNGs were viewed: desktop review, Chinese/English/Japanese 390px, actual Save conflict and WebGL2-independent review. The global selected count and hidden-selected count are explicit, source UUIDs and raw CRLF names remain readable, comparison content is scrollable, and sticky action controls remain reachable without horizontal overflow.",
    "Desktop approval capture is made after two actual animation frames and an enabled-Apply assertion. Button availability is proven by actual DOM state and successful native Apply; no particular ready-state color is inferred from the dark theme.",
    "The twenty-five old-author PNGs were all viewed before the translation row repair. Those author controllers, helpers, host and dictionaries remain unchanged; their recorded execution phase is retained and is not substituted for final translation-row acceptance.",
    "Ten representative final selection/navigation/readonly PNGs were viewed, including physical selected edges, Japanese narrow view, near clipping, 128-object navigation, invalid retained preview and explicit no-WebGL fallback. The remaining eight produced legacy readonly PNGs are not claimed personally viewed.",
    "Full candidate contents, all changed object declarations, saved bytes, ownership/brand checks and GPU hash differences are browser assertions, not full-document visual inspection."
  ],
  "phaseNote": "Forty-one listed image regions were personally inspected across the stated phases. Earlier translation screenshots and independent reviewer visual reports are not overwritten or represented as final source."
